config BR2_PACKAGE_MPS3_HARNESSD
	bool "mps3-harnessd"
	help
	  The MPS3 shell's firmware service modules (coordinator, swap FSM,
	  config agent, JTAG/XVC/UART servers, CLCD/KVM/touch, clkrst,
	  identify) compiled UNMODIFIED for Linux as one process, against
	  the UIO register HAL, kernel sockets and a poll()-driven service
	  table (src/linux_harness/sw/harnessd/,
	  docs/planning/linux_lanes/HARNESSD_CONTRACT.md). Speaks the
	  bare-metal wire (net-protocol v0.11) plus the additive
	  version.impl = "linux".

	  Installs /usr/sbin/mps3-harnessd and the inittab drop-in
	  /usr/share/mps3/inittab.d/50-mps3-harnessd.inittab
	  (::respawn:/usr/sbin/mps3-harnessd), which IMAGE's provisioning
	  merges into /etc/inittab (IMAGE_CONTRACT.md §7.1).

	  Replaces the v0.7 hand-ported daemons, which stay buildable as
	  BR2_PACKAGE_MPS3_LEGACY_DAEMONS (the two are mutually exclusive:
	  they bind the same ports).
